e from WordPress.\u0004Default":["Predvolen\u00e9"],"Indicates these doutone filters are created by the user.\u0004Custom":["Vlastn\u00fd"],"Apply the selected revision to your site.":["Pou\u017eite vybran\u00fa rev\u00edziu na svoju str\u00e1nku."],"Global Styles pagination":["St\u00e1nkovanie glob\u00e1lnych \u0161t\u00fdlov"],"verb\u0004Filter":["Filtrova\u0165"],"Navigate to item":["Prejs\u0165 na polo\u017eku"],"Density":["Hustota"],"Density option for DataView layout\u0004Comfortable":["Komfortn\u00e1"],"Density option for DataView layout\u0004Balanced":["Vyv\u00e1\u017een\u00e1"],"Density option for DataView layout\u0004Compact":["Kompaktn\u00e1"],"A paragraph in a website refers to a distinct block of text that is used to present and organize information. It is a fundamental unit of content in web design and is typically composed of a group of related sentences or thoughts focused on a particular topic or idea. Paragraphs play a crucial role in improving the readability and user experience of a website. They break down the text into smaller, manageable chunks, allowing readers to scan the content more easily.":["Odsek na webovej str\u00e1nke ozna\u010duje samostatn\u00fd blok textu, ktor\u00fd sl\u00fa\u017ei na prezent\u00e1ciu a organiz\u00e1ciu inform\u00e1ci\u00ed. Je to z\u00e1kladn\u00e1 jednotka obsahu v dizajne webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nok a zvy\u010dajne sa sklad\u00e1 zo skupiny s\u00favisiacich viet alebo my\u0161lienok zameran\u00fdch na konkr\u00e9tnu t\u00e9mu alebo my\u0161lienku. Odseky hraj\u00fa k\u013e\u00fa\u010dov\u00fa \u00falohu pri zlep\u0161ovan\u00ed \u010ditate\u013enosti a pou\u017e\u00edvate\u013esk\u00e9ho z\u00e1\u017eitku z webovej str\u00e1nky. Rozde\u013euj\u00fa text na men\u0161ie, preh\u013eadnej\u0161ie \u010dasti, \u010do \u010ditate\u013eom umo\u017e\u0148uje \u013eah\u0161ie prehliada\u0165 obsah."],"Additionally, paragraphs help structure the flow of information and provide logical breaks between different concepts or pieces of information. In terms of formatting, paragraphs in websites are commonly denoted by a vertical gap or indentation between each block of text. This visual separation helps visually distinguish one paragraph from another, creating a clear and organized layout that guides the reader through the content smoothly.":["Okrem toho odseky pom\u00e1haj\u00fa \u0161trukt\u00farova\u0165 tok inform\u00e1ci\u00ed a poskytuj\u00fa logick\u00e9 prest\u00e1vky medzi r\u00f4znymi pojmami alebo inform\u00e1ciami. Pokia\u013e ide o form\u00e1tovanie, odseky na webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nkach sa zvy\u010dajne ozna\u010duj\u00fa vertik\u00e1lnou medzerou alebo odsaden\u00edm medzi jednotliv\u00fdmi blokmi textu. Toto vizu\u00e1lne oddelenie pom\u00e1ha vizu\u00e1lne odl\u00ed\u0161i\u0165 jeden odsek od druh\u00e9ho, \u010d\u00edm sa vytv\u00e1ra preh\u013eadn\u00e9 a organizovan\u00e9 rozlo\u017eenie, ktor\u00e9 hladko vedie \u010ditate\u013ea obsahom."],"This field can't be moved up":["Toto pole sa ned\u00e1 posun\u00fa\u0165 vy\u0161\u0161ie"],"This field can't be moved down":["Toto pole sa ned\u00e1 posun\u00fa\u0165 ni\u017e\u0161ie"],"Status & Visibility":["Stav a vidite\u013enos\u0165"],"Preview your website's visual identity: colors, typography, and blocks.":["Pozrite si n\u00e1h\u013ead vizu\u00e1lnej identity va\u0161ej web str\u00e1nky: farby, typografiu a bloky."],"The requested page could not be found. Please check the URL.":["Po\u017eadovan\u00e1 str\u00e1nka sa nena\u0161la. Skontrolujte URL adresu."],"Enable infinite scroll":["Povoli\u0165 nekone\u010dn\u00e9 pos\u00favanie"],"Reset view":["Obnovi\u0165 zobrazenie"],"Learn more":["Zisti\u0165 viac"],"Table":["Tabu\u013eka"],"%d Revision":["%d rev\u00edzia","%d rev\u00edzie","%d rev\u00edzi\u00ed"],"Saving":["Uklad\u00e1 sa"],"Headings":["Nadpisy"],"Save your changes.":["Ulo\u017ete va\u0161e zmeny."],"Embeds":["Vlo\u017een\u00e9 prvky"],"Create":["Vytvori\u0165"],"Page %1$d of %2$d":["Str\u00e1nka %1$d z %2$d"],"Welcome Guide":["Sprievodca na priv\u00edtanie"],"Get started":["Za\u010d\u00edname"],"Buttons":["Tla\u010didl\u00e1"],"Review changes":["Skontrolujte zmeny"],"Open save panel":["Otvori\u0165 panel ulo\u017eenia"],"Design":["Dizajn"],"Shadows":["Tiene"],"Customize the appearance of specific blocks for the whole site.":["Prisp\u00f4sobte vzh\u013ead konkr\u00e9tnych blokov pre cel\u00fa web str\u00e1nku."],"Customize the appearance of specific blocks and for the whole site.":["Prisp\u00f4sobte vzh\u013ead konkr\u00e9tnych blokov a celej web str\u00e1nky."],"Aa":["Aa"],"Drag to resize":["Potiahnut\u00edm zmen\u00edte ve\u013ekos\u0165"],"Welcome to the site editor":["Vitajte v editore str\u00e1nky"],"Edit your site":["Upravi\u0165 va\u0161u webov\u00fa str\u00e1nku"],"Design everything on your site \u2014 from the header right down to the footer \u2014 using blocks.":["Navrhnite v\u0161etko na svojom webe \u2013 od hlavi\u010dky a\u017e po p\u00e4tu \u2013 pomocou blokov."],"Click <StylesIconImage \/> to start designing your blocks, and choose your typography, layout, and colors.":["Kliknut\u00edm na <StylesIconImage \/> za\u010dnite navrhova\u0165 bloky a vyberte typografiu, rozlo\u017eenie a farby."],"styles":["\u0160t\u00fdly"],"Welcome to Styles":["Vitajte v \u0160t\u00fdloch"],"Tweak your site, or give it a whole new look! Get creative \u2014 how about a new color palette for your buttons, or choosing a new font? Take a look at what you can do here.":["Vyla\u010fte svoju str\u00e1nku alebo jej dajte \u00faplne nov\u00fd vzh\u013ead! Bu\u010fte kreat\u00edvny \u2013 \u010do tak nov\u00e1 farebn\u00e1 paleta pre tla\u010didl\u00e1 alebo v\u00fdber nov\u00e9ho p\u00edsma? Pozrite sa, \u010do tu m\u00f4\u017eete robi\u0165."],"Set the design":["Nastavte design"],"You can customize your site as much as you like with different colors, typography, and layouts. Or if you prefer, just leave it up to your theme to handle!":["Svoju str\u00e1nku si m\u00f4\u017eete prisp\u00f4sobi\u0165 pod\u013ea svojich predst\u00e1v pomocou r\u00f4znych farieb, typografie a rozlo\u017eenia. Alebo ak chcete, nechajte to na va\u0161ej t\u00e9me, ktor\u00fa zvl\u00e1dnete!"],"Personalize blocks":["Prisp\u00f4sobte bloky"],"You can adjust your blocks to ensure a cohesive experience across your site \u2014 add your unique colors to a branded Button block, or adjust the Heading block to your preferred size.":["Svoje bloky m\u00f4\u017eete upravi\u0165, aby ste zaistili s\u00fadr\u017en\u00fd z\u00e1\u017eitok na svojom webe \u2013 pridajte svoje jedine\u010dn\u00e9 farby do zna\u010dkov\u00e9ho bloku tla\u010didiel alebo upravte blok nadpisov na preferovan\u00fa ve\u013ekos\u0165."],"New to block themes and styling your site?":["Ste nov\u00e1\u010dikom, \u010do sa t\u00fdka blokov\u00fdch t\u00e9m a \u0161t\u00fdlovania va\u0161ej web str\u00e1nky?"],"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/documentation\/article\/styles-overview\/":["https:\/\/wordpress.org\/documentation\/article\/styles-overview\/"],"Here\u2019s a detailed guide to learn how to make the most of it.":["Tu je podrobn\u00fd n\u00e1vod, ako z neho vy\u0165a\u017ei\u0165 maximum."],"The \"%s\" plugin has encountered an error and cannot be rendered.":["V plugine \"%s\" sa vyskytla chyba chyba a nem\u00f4\u017ee by\u0165 zobrazen\u00fd."],"Browse styles":["Prehliada\u0165 \u0161t\u00fdly"],"\"%s\" successfully created.":["\u0160abl\u00f3na \"%s\" bola \u00faspe\u0161ne vytvoren\u00e1."],"%s styles applied.":["%s \u0161t\u00fdly aplikovan\u00e9."],"Apply this block\u2019s typography, spacing, dimensions, and color styles to all %s blocks.":["Pou\u017ei\u0165 typografiu, medzery, rozmery a farebn\u00e9 \u0161t\u00fdly tohto bloku na v\u0161etky bloky %s."],"Apply globally":["Aplikova\u0165 glob\u00e1lne."],"Style Variations":["Vari\u00e1cie \u0161t\u00fdlov"],"Style Book":["Preh\u013ead \u0161t\u00fdlov"],"Template part":["\u010cas\u0165 \u0161abl\u00f3ny"],"Customize the appearance of your website using the b